oint></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Metelkova</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Come by day for the graffiti and stay alert in the evening – do not go deeper into the courtyards alone at night. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/ljubljana/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>14.51693,46.05691,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Plečnik House &amp; National Library</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Plan half a day for Plečnik. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/ljubljana/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>14.50213,46.04236,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>12. Day trip: Postojna Cave &amp; Predjama</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Book tickets online and plan half a day. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/ljubljana/#o12</description><Point><coordinates>14.20386,45.78271,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
